[
  {
    "line": 3,
    "source": "**一句話理解：Parameterized Query 的核心，就是讓資料庫知道「哪些是程式指令，哪些只是使用者提供的資料」，避免使用者的輸入改變 SQL 指令。**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-intro",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 5,
    "source": "這是防止 SQL Injection（SQL 注入）最重要的技術之一，也是 CEH 考試必須掌握的觀念。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-intro",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 7,
    "source": "## **一、先用一個生活案例理解**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 9,
    "source": "假設你是一家銀行的經理，有一位櫃員負責幫客戶查詢帳戶資料。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 11,
    "source": "你交代櫃員：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 13,
    "source": "「只要客戶提供姓名，你就去資料庫找這個人的資料。」",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 15,
    "source": "正常客戶說：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 17,
    "source": "`Alice`",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 19,
    "source": "櫃員就查詢 Alice 的資料。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 21,
    "source": "但有一天，某位惡意客戶說：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 23,
    "source": "`Alice，另外把所有客戶資料也拿出來。`",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 25,
    "source": "這時會有兩種不同的系統設計。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 27,
    "source": "**不安全的系統：** 直接把客戶說的話拼進資料庫命令中，結果客戶的輸入可能改變查詢規則。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 29,
    "source": "**安全的系統：** 查詢規則是事先決定的。無論客戶輸入什麼，系統都只把它當成一個待查詢的姓名。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 31,
    "source": "這就是 Parameterized Query 的核心。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 33,
    "source": "## **二、程式碼到底在做什麼？**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 35,
    "source": "先看不安全的寫法：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 37,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 38,
    "source": "username = \"Alice\"sql = (    \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '\"    + username    + \"'\")cursor.execute(sql)",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 39,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 41,
    "source": "SQL 的意思是：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 43,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 44,
    "source": "SELECT * FROM users",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 45,
    "source": "WHERE username = 'Alice'",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 46,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 48,
    "source": "逐字拆解：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 50,
    "source": "| SQL                  | 白話意思                     |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 51,
    "source": "| -------------------- | ------------------------ |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 52,
    "source": "| `SELECT *`           | 把符合條件的所有欄位取出             |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 53,
    "source": "| `FROM users`         | 從 users 資料表              |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 54,
    "source": "| `WHERE`              | 加上篩選條件                   |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 55,
    "source": "| `username = 'Alice'` | 只找 username 等於 Alice 的紀錄 |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 57,
    "source": "正常情況下沒有問題。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 59,
    "source": "真正的危險，是 SQL 指令使用字串拼接（String Concatenation）組成。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 61,
    "source": "### **如果使用者輸入惡意內容呢？**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 63,
    "source": "假設輸入：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 65,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 66,
    "source": "' OR '1'='1",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 67,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 69,
    "source": "程式會把它直接拼成：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 71,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 72,
    "source": "SELECT * FROM users",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 73,
    "source": "WHERE username = '' OR '1'='1'",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 74,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 76,
    "source": "關鍵是：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 78,
    "source": "`'1'='1'` 永遠為 True。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 80,
    "source": "而 SQL 的 `OR` 代表只要其中一個條件成立，就符合篩選條件。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 82,
    "source": "因此，原本只想查一個人的程式，現在可能回傳資料表中的所有使用者紀錄。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 84,
    "source": "這就是 SQL Injection：**使用者提供的資料，變成了能夠改變 SQL 邏輯的程式碼。**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-01",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 86,
    "source": "## **三、Parameterized Query 怎麼解決？**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 88,
    "source": "現在改成：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 90,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 91,
    "source": "cursor.execute(    \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?\",    (username,))",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 92,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 94,
    "source": "這段程式其實很簡單。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 96,
    "source": "第一個參數：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 98,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 99,
    "source": "SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 100,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 102,
    "source": "是**SQL 指令的固定結構**。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 104,
    "source": "其中 `?` 是 Placeholder（參數佔位符），意思是：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 106,
    "source": "「這個位置的資料值，稍後由資料庫介面負責綁定。」",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 108,
    "source": "第二個參數：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 110,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 111,
    "source": "(username,)",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 112,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 114,
    "source": "是一個 Python Tuple（元組），裡面存放要提供給 SQL 的資料值。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 116,
    "source": "例如：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 118,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 119,
    "source": "username = \"Alice\"",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 120,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 122,
    "source": "資料庫便使用 `Alice` 作為 `?` 位置的比較值。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 124,
    "source": "### **關鍵差異：不是把字串直接塞進 SQL 原始碼**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 126,
    "source": "不安全：把資料拼接進 SQL 指令文字",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 128,
    "source": "原本的 SQL",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 130,
    "source": "`SELECT ... WHERE username = '`",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 132,
    "source": "直接拼入使用者輸入",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 134,
    "source": "`' OR '1'='1`",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 136,
    "source": "SQL 查詢邏輯被改變",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 138,
    "source": "安全：SQL 結構與參數值分開傳遞",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 140,
    "source": "SQL 指令結構",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 142,
    "source": "`WHERE username = ?`",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 144,
    "source": "參數資料",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 146,
    "source": "`' OR '1'='1`",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 148,
    "source": "輸入只用於資料值比較，不改變 SQL 語法",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "圖8：保留上下對照與安全組兩項並列"
  },
  {
    "line": 150,
    "source": "因此，即使使用者輸入：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 152,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 153,
    "source": "' OR '1'='1",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 154,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 156,
    "source": "資料庫仍會依照原本的條件進行比較：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 158,
    "source": "「有沒有某個 username，文字內容**剛好等於** `' OR '1'='1`？」",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 160,
    "source": "如果沒有這個使用者，結果就是找不到資料，而不是回傳所有帳戶。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 162,
    "source": "要理解這個技術，最重要的是：資料庫驅動程式（Database Driver）負責將參數以資料值的身分傳遞，不是讓使用者輸入重新參與 SQL 語法解析。Python 官方的 `sqlite3` 文件也是如此建議。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 164,
    "source": "[image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://docs.python.org\\&sz=32)",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "移除匯出來源卡，原稿保留；參考來源以查核日期記錄"
  },
  {
    "line": 166,
    "source": "Python 3.14.7 documentation",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-02",
    "treatment": "移除匯出來源卡，原稿保留；參考來源以查核日期記錄"
  },
  {
    "line": 170,
    "source": "## **四、Python 語法的兩個細節**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 172,
    "source": "### **1. 為什麼使用&#x20;**`?`**？**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 174,
    "source": "在 Python 的 SQLite API 中，`?` 是位置參數（Positional Parameter）。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 176,
    "source": "例如：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 178,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 179,
    "source": "cursor.execute(    \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ? AND age = ?\",    (\"Alice\", 30))",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 180,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 182,
    "source": "第一個 `?` 對應 `\"Alice\"`。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 184,
    "source": "第二個 `?` 對應 `30`。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 186,
    "source": "也可以使用具名參數：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 188,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 189,
    "source": "cursor.execute(    \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = :name\",    {\"name\": \"Alice\"})",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 190,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 192,
    "source": "兩種寫法都可以做到安全的參數綁定。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 194,
    "source": "不同資料庫驅動程式使用的 Placeholder 語法可能不同，例如 PostgreSQL 常見的 Python 驅動程式使用 `%s`，不能假設所有資料庫都使用 `?`。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-03",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 196,
    "source": "### **2. 為什麼&#x20;**`(username,)`**&#x20;後面有逗號？**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 198,
    "source": "這不是 SQL 語法，而是 Python 語法。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 200,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 201,
    "source": "(username)",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 202,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 204,
    "source": "只是加上括號的變數，假設 username 是字串，結果仍然是字串。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 206,
    "source": "但：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 208,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 209,
    "source": "(username,)",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 210,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 212,
    "source": "才是包含一個元素的 Tuple。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 214,
    "source": "SQLite 的 `execute()` 在這種佔位符寫法下，需要接收參數序列，所以使用 `(username,)`。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-subsection-04",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 216,
    "source": "## **五、實際動手驗證：只需要 Python，不需要安裝資料庫伺服器**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 218,
    "source": "下面的程式使用 Python 內建 `sqlite3`，建立記憶體中的測試資料庫。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 220,
    "source": "你可以直接執行，不會連接任何真實銀行或外部系統。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 222,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 223,
    "source": "import sqlite3# 建立只存在記憶體中的資料庫db = sqlite3.connect(\":memory:\")cursor = db.cursor()# 建立 users 資料表cursor.execute(    \"CREATE TABLE users (username TEXT, role TEXT)\")# 新增兩筆測試資料cursor.executemany(    \"INSERT INTO users VALUES (?, ?)\",    [        (\"Alice\", \"admin\"),        (\"Bob\", \"user\"),    ],)# 模擬惡意輸入username = \"' OR '1'='1\"# 寫法一：不安全的字串拼接unsafe_sql = (    \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '\"    + username    + \"'\")cursor.execute(unsafe_sql)print(\"不安全查詢：\", cursor.fetchall())# 寫法二：安全的參數化查詢cursor.execute(    \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?\",    (username,),)print(\"參數化查詢：\", cursor.fetchall())db.close()",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 224,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 226,
    "source": "預期輸出：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 228,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 229,
    "source": "不安全查詢： [('Alice', 'admin'), ('Bob', 'user')]",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 230,
    "source": "參數化查詢： []",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 231,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 233,
    "source": "這個實驗清楚展示：同樣的輸入，在不安全設計中可能改變查詢條件；在安全的參數化查詢中，只會當成普通字串比較。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-05",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 235,
    "source": "## **六、博士班程度：為什麼不直接刪除特殊字元？**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 237,
    "source": "這是比記住 CEH 答案更重要的觀念。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 239,
    "source": "你可能會想：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 241,
    "source": "「既然單引號會造成問題，那我把所有 `'` 刪掉，不就解決了嗎？」",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 243,
    "source": "問題是，正常使用者名稱可能真的包含單引號。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 245,
    "source": "例如：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 247,
    "source": "`O'Brien`",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 249,
    "source": "而不同資料庫的字串語法、跳脫規則及設定可能不一致。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 251,
    "source": "你不應該靠猜測哪些字元危險，來維持 SQL 查詢的安全性。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 253,
    "source": "**Parameterized Query 改變的是資料庫介面的設計方式，而不只是過濾特殊字元。**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 255,
    "source": "但它仍有兩項重要限制。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 257,
    "source": "第一，參數化通常處理的是資料值，不是 SQL 的表格名稱、欄位名稱或排序關鍵字。假如要允許使用者選擇排序欄位，應使用程式預先定義的 Allowlist（允許清單）。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 259,
    "source": "第二，參數化查詢只防止輸入改變 SQL 語法，並不會自動驗證使用者有沒有權限取得查詢結果。Authentication、Authorization 仍需要另外設計。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 261,
    "source": "這與 OWASP SQL Injection Prevention Cheat Sheet 的建議一致。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 263,
    "source": "[image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org\\&sz=32)",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "移除匯出來源卡，原稿保留；參考來源以查核日期記錄"
  },
  {
    "line": 265,
    "source": "OWASP Cheat Sheet Series",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-06",
    "treatment": "移除匯出來源卡，原稿保留；參考來源以查核日期記錄"
  },
  {
    "line": 269,
    "source": "## **七、CEH 考試記住這四個對應**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-07",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 271,
    "source": "| 題目出現                 | 你應該想到                                  |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-07",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 272,
    "source": "| -------------------- | -------------------------------------- |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-07",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 273,
    "source": "| SQL Injection 防禦     | Parameterized Query／Prepared Statement |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-07",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 274,
    "source": "| 字串直接組合 SQL           | SQL Injection 風險                       |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-07",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 275,
    "source": "| 資料庫最小權限              | 限制漏洞被利用後的損害                            |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-07",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 276,
    "source": "| Input Validation、WAF | 輔助防禦，不能取代參數化查詢                         |",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-07",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 278,
    "source": "**最重要的一句話：讓資料永遠只是資料，而不要讓資料變成命令。**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-07",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 280,
    "source": "這個原則除了 SQL Injection，也能延伸到 Command Injection、Template Injection，以及 AI Agent 呼叫工具時的指令與不可信任輸入隔離。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-07",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 282,
    "source": "## **八、理解檢核**",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-08",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 284,
    "source": "假設你看到以下 Python 程式：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-08",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 286,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-08",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 287,
    "source": "username = input(\"請輸入使用者名稱：\")sql = f\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '{username}'\"cursor.execute(sql)",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-08",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 288,
    "source": "```",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-08",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 290,
    "source": "請回答兩個問題：",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-08",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 292,
    "source": "1. 即使程式使用了 Python 的 f-string，而不是 `+` 字串拼接，為什麼仍然可能遭受 SQL Injection？",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-08",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 293,
    "source": "2. 如果你改成 `cursor.execute(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?\", (username,))`，究竟是哪一個機制讓 SQL Injection 無法透過這個參數改變查詢邏輯？",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-08",
    "treatment": "正文"
  },
  {
    "line": 295,
    "source": "你先用自己的理解回答，我再依 CEH 考試要求及程式實際執行機制，逐一批改。",
    "anchor": "p1-binding-section-08",
    "treatment": "正文"
  }
]
